<title>CANADA: Canada to auction C$3 bln 6.25 pct bonds due 1998.</title>
<headline>Canada to auction C$3 bln 6.25 pct bonds due 1998.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada said it plans to auction on September 4 a total of C$3.0 billion of bonds with a coupon of 6.25 percent and maturing on September 15, 1998.</p>
</text>
